  ('transnetbw', 'TransnetBW', 'tso', 'DE', '{}'::text[], '{}'::text[], '{}'::text[], 'The transmission grid and control area of Baden-Württemberg; whether its borders are exactly the state''s was not read.', 'https://www.transnetbw.de/', null, '{}'::jsonb, null, '10XDE-ENBW--TNGX', 'A transmission system operator of the bidding zone DE-LU, responsible for the control area 10YDE-ENBW-----N.', 'pack:de'),
