      ('electricity_excise'::text, null::text, '{}'::jsonb, '20.5'::jsonb, 'EUR-PER-MegaW-HR'::text, '2026-11-07'::date, null::date, 'de_stromstg'::text, '§ 3: the tax is 20.50 euros per megawatt hour. The reliefs and refunds of the act (§ 9, § 9b for manufacturing businesses and agriculture) are not loaded; the row starts on the day it was read'::text, 'published'::text),
